		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Giant 20-foot-tall skeleton wrapped in ebony robes, head is a massive horse skull.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 58, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 claw +8 (1d10) or splintered ground, <strong>MV</strong> near (fly), <strong>S</strong> +5, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +4, <strong>I</strong> +0, <strong>W</strong> +4, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 12</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Spawn Skeleton</strong>. Mortals who die within double near of saxra, 3:6 chance of rising as skeleton in 1d4 rounds.</p><p></p><p><strong>Splintered Ground</strong>. Broken bones thrust out of earth for a far-sized cube centered on saxra, difficult movement.</p><p></p><p><strong>Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
